rows.en:
That cherry tree watched that scene the whole time.
I'm sure it was a sight it never wanted to see.
I bet even if it wanted to look away, even if it wanted to shut off its mind, it couldn't.{p}

That's the spirit.
I don't tell lies, you know.
Come on, let's go take a look.{p}

...The area around the old school building really is creepy, isn't it?
To be honest, I can't stand the atmosphere around here.
Every time I come, it feels like something's about to show up.{p}

Well?
Did you see them?
You saw them, didn't you?{p}

{f:Just as I thought|Whaaat}, {f:I knew you'd say that.|you hate them?}
{f:I shouldn't have asked a boy.|You're no fun.}
I don't think any living thing is as beautiful as they are, though.
Of all flowers, I really love cherry blossoms.{p}

Your answer to my question earlier was heard loud and clear{f:, you know|, though}.
Huh?
By what, you ask?{p}

{f:Wow|Well, well}, {f:for a boy, you're|you're quite} a romantic, aren't you?
But you've got good taste.
Hee hee, actually I love cherry blossoms too.{p}

After that, she stopped going near the cherry tree.
Then, the day before graduation, she must have been worried about it after all...
After school, she quietly came to see how the tree was doing.{p}

What are you so relieved about?
Just because they're all good spirits doesn't mean you can relax.
Why? Because the cherry tree is binding the spirits that are trying to pass on, trapping them inside itself...{p}

That's more like it.
I'm not lying, you know.
Come on, let's go.{p}

"I want your body..."
That's the end of my story.
Well then, next person, go ahead...{p}

Do you really think so?
"Let's chop that tree down."
...Weren't you the one saying stuff like that?{p}

Ahaha, you're starting to get scared, huh.
That's a relief.
I was starting to think I was the only scaredy-cat.{p}

But you can feel it, right?
That swirl of sinister energy wrapping itself around this school...
And right at the center of it is that cherry tree.{p}

Hurry up and throw them away!
……………
……………{p}

Heh heh heh.
That's the end of my story.
Well then, next person, go ahead...{p}
